menu "OTAV agent"

    config OTAV_MARK_VALID_AFTER_MS
        int "Mark a freshly updated image valid after (ms)"
        default 15000
        range 0 600000
        help
            With rollback enabled, a new image boots as PENDING_VERIFY. The agent
            marks it valid after it has run this long. Set 0 to leave it pending
            until OTAV (or the app) marks it valid or rolls it back.

endmenu
